[thin] The retained Pisco spring is a flexure with the fitted cap's leaf section, free length and root blend. The structural-wall threshold does not describe the spring's job. The full L cover still needs a physical retention trial.
alternatives: Thickening the leaf changes the specified flexure. The cover's body and hardware bearing remain independent of the spring's bending span.
